# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Game capture artifacts.
#
# These are screenshots of the running game, so they contain its artwork,
# sprites, portraits, and stage backgrounds. None of it is ours to publish,
# and it accounts for ~815 MB of the working tree. Regenerate locally instead
# of committing: most tools write their own output.
#
# This pattern is deliberately broad. If you ever need to track a legitimate
# image, add it with `git add -f`.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.bmp
*.png

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Game data and anything derived from the executable's bytes.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.lzh
*.pkl
codeindex.pkl

# Tool output written next to the scripts.
th06c-tools/*.txt

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dead ends and one-off probes, kept on disk for reference only.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
th06c-tools/scratch/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment and editor noise.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
.multiloop/
.pi/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
